      "transcript_text": "One thing at a time, please. How long has this extra breathlessness been going on?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:53",
      "end_timestamp": "00:59",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Two weeks, I think. Only two weeks.",
